    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dublin 12 Opportunity | 3-Bed, 2-Bath Mid-Terrace Home with Huge Potential\r\n\r\nPerfectly located near the Luas Red Line, this extended 3-bedroom property offers a functional layout, two bathrooms, and the ideal canvas for buyers looking to modernize and put their own stamp on a D12 home.\r\n\r\nDescription\r\nWelcome to 3 Galtymore Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12 (Eircode: D12 AD62)—a well-located 3-bedroom mid-terrace house situated in a highly convenient pocket of Dublin 12. Representing a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, renovators, or investors, this property offers solid fundamentals and a practical layout ready for modern updates.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features two reception rooms fitted with wooden floors. While the home requires cosmetic updates and modernization throughout, it already benefits from valuable key features—most notably a ground-floor extension providing two full bathrooms, as well as gas-fired central heating.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Highlights\r\nLiving Spaces: Two distinct ground-floor reception rooms with wooden floors, offering strong bones to redesign or open up into a contemporary living space.\r\n\r\nKitchen & Bathrooms: A functional rear kitchen complemented by two full bathrooms (one on the ground floor and one upstairs).\r\n\r\nBedrooms: Three bedrooms upstairs (two doubles and a single ideal for a home office).\r\n\r\nLow-Maintenance Garden: A private, low-maintenance rear garden requiring minimal upkeep.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nProperty Address & Eircode: 3 Galtymore Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12 | D12 AD62\r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms (Practical dual-bathroom layout)\r\n\r\nWooden Floors in both reception rooms\r\n\r\nModernization Opportunity: Blank canvas to upgrade and add value\r\n\r\nLow-Maintenance Rear Garden\r\n\r\nGas-Fired Central Heating (GFCH) & double-glazed windows\r\n\r\nPrime D12 Location: Short walk to Goldenbridge & Suir Road Luas Red Line stops"
      },
      {
